---
import NutritionistLayout from "./components/NutritionistLayout.astro";
---

<NutritionistLayout
  title="Agendar consulta nutricional | Claudia Valenzuela"
  description="Agenda una consulta nutricional con Claudia Valenzuela en Providencia u online. Cuéntanos brevemente qué necesitas."
  currentPath="/contact"
>
  <section class="contact-section">
    <div class="contact-shape" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="shell contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contacto</p>
        <h1>Hablemos de lo que hoy necesitas.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Completa el formulario y te escribiré dentro de un día hábil para coordinar una hora o resolver tus dudas.</p>
        <div class="contact-details">
          <div><span>Correo</span><a href="mailto:hola@claudiarinutricion.cl">hola@claudiarinutricion.cl</a></div>
          <div><span>WhatsApp</span><a href="tel:+56961234567">+56 9 6123 4567</a></div>
          <div><span>Consulta</span><p>Av. Los Leones 1450, Providencia<br />Metro Inés de Suárez</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <form class="contact-form" action="/thanks" method="get">
        <div class="field-row">
          <label>Nombre <input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="¿Cómo te llamas?" required /></label>
          <label>Correo <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="tu@correo.cl" required /></label>
        </div>
        <label>Teléfono <input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+56 9" /></label>
        <fieldset><legend>¿Qué tipo de atención prefieres?</legend><div class="radio-grid"><label><input type="radio" name="format" value="online" checked /><span><strong>Online</strong><small>Desde cualquier ciudad</small></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="format" value="presencial" /><span><strong>Presencial</strong><small>Providencia, Santiago</small></span></label></div></fieldset>
        <label>¿En qué te gustaría que te acompañe?<select name="reason" required><option value="">Selecciona una opción</option><option>Ordenar mi alimentación</option><option>Mejorar mi relación con la comida</option><option>Bienestar digestivo</option><option>Nutrición y actividad física</option><option>Otra consulta</option></select></label>
        <label>Cuéntame un poco más <textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="No necesitas explicarlo perfecto. Con unas líneas es suficiente."></textarea></label>
        <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required /><span>Acepto que mis datos sean usados para responder esta solicitud. <a href="/privacy-policy">Ver privacidad</a>.</span></label>
        <button class="button" type="submit">Enviar solicitud <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        <p class="form-note">Este formulario no es un canal de urgencia médica.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section availability-section"><div class="shell availability-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Disponibilidad habitual</p><h2>Horarios pensados para integrarse a tu semana.</h2></div><div class="schedule"><div><span>Lunes y miércoles</span><strong>09:00 — 18:30</strong></div><div><span>Martes y jueves</span><strong>11:00 — 20:00</strong></div><div><span>Viernes</span><strong>Solo online · 09:00 — 14:00</strong></div></div></div></section>
</NutritionistLayout>

<style>
  .contact-section { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem) 0; background: var(--surface); }
  .contact-grid { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; align-items: start; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .contact-intro { position: sticky; top: 2rem; }
  .contact-intro h1 { max-width: 10ch; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6.5rem); }
  .contact-details { margin-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .contact-details > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1rem 0; }
  .contact-details span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .68rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .contact-details a, .contact-details p { margin: 0; color: var(--greenDark); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .contact-form { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 2rem; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); background: white; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
  .field-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  .contact-form > label, .field-row label { display: grid; gap: .45rem; color: var(--greenDark); font-size: .73rem; font-weight: 700; }
  input, select, textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 3.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .8rem; padding: .85rem 1rem; background: var(--cream); color: var(--text); }
  textarea { resize: vertical; }
  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { border-color: var(--green); }
  fieldset { margin: 0; border: 0; padding: 0; }
  legend { margin-bottom: .55rem; color: var(--greenDark); font-size: .73rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .radio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .75rem; }
  .radio-grid label { position: relative; cursor: pointer; }
  .radio-grid input { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; opacity: 0; }
  .radio-grid span { display: grid; min-height: 5rem; align-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: .8rem; padding: 1rem; background: var(--cream); }
  .radio-grid input:checked + span { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--limeLight); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--green); }
  .radio-grid input:focus-visible + span { outline: 3px solid var(--terracotta); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .radio-grid small { margin-top: .2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .consent { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr !important; align-items: start; }
  .consent input { width: 1.1rem; min-height: 1.1rem; margin-top: .2rem; accent-color: var(--green); }
  .consent span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .consent a { text-decoration: underline; }
  .contact-form button { justify-self: start; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .form-note { margin: -.4rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .65rem; }
  .contact-shape { position: absolute; width: 22rem; height: 10rem; right: -8rem; bottom: 8rem; border-radius: 80% 20% 80% 20%; background: var(--limeLight); transform: rotate(-25deg); }
  .availability-section { background: var(--cream); }
  .availability-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .8fr; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); }
  .availability-grid h2 { max-width: 14ch; }
  .schedule { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .schedule > div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1.15rem 0; }
  .schedule span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; }
  .schedule strong { color: var(--greenDark); font-size: .78rem; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .contact-grid, .availability-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .contact-intro { position: static; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .field-row, .radio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .contact-details > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .25rem; } .schedule > div { flex-direction: column; gap: .25rem; } }
</style>
